    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Ed Ruscha has continued to explore the interpolation and juxtaposition of word and image well into the 21st century. A Catalogue Raisonnée of his paintings is under development at: www.edruschacatalogue.com. Currently (July 2007), it is complete until the late eighties.",
